{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_08980","headline":"滁州园池燕元氏亲属 · 韦应物","name":"滁州园池燕元氏亲属","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"日暮游清池，疎林罗高天。\n余绿飘霜露，夕气变风烟。\n水门架危阁，竹亭列广筵。\n一展私姻礼，屡叹芳樽前。\n感往在兹会，伤离属頽年。\n明晨复云去，且愿此流连。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦应物","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_08980.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_08980","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}